EVALUATION.md §10.3: for a value subject, naming a package check of the test's package is E5004
(`packageCheck` variant), which says only `expect package` runs it; any other missing name is `value`.
-- teamboard/expects.canon --
package teamboard

record Slot {
  size: Int

  check fits: size < 10 else "too big"
}

check global: 1 == 1 else "x"

test "package check by value" {
  expect slot fails global
  expect slot fails fits
  expect slot fails missing
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E5004]  teamboard/expects.canon:12:21
  no check named global applies to teamboard.Slot; global is a package check, which only expect package runs

error[E5004]  teamboard/expects.canon:14:21
  no check named missing applies to teamboard.Slot

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
